Unofficial SoftEther VPN
Independent Android client for the SoftEther VPN protocol.

SoftEther VPN Stable
--------------------
This application includes the SoftEther VPN Stable v4.44-9807-rtm core,
built with Android-specific changes recorded in native-core-source/softether-android.patch.
