Android client history
----------------------
Earlier versions of this Android client were based on Minimum VPN Client for
SoftEther VPN, upstream baseline 289fa2d.
Copyright 2021 KOBAYASHI Ittoku.
Source: https://github.com/kittoku/Minimum-VPN-Client-for-SoftEther-VPN
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original LICENSE is retained
with that credit. The current Android implementation replaces the earlier VPN
backend and uses its own application ID.

